{"song_id": 8101455, "title": "Salope de 2006", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [55334], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "intro", "performer": "", "lines": [], "rhyme": "", "rhyme_vowel": ""}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "ouais,", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Hahahahahahahahahaha...", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "T'as 35 ans, tu vis \u00e0 Neuilly", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Le soir avec tes amis, tu t'\u00e9clates dans ta Mini", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Tu flippes pour tes deux bagnoles, ta r\u00e9sidence secondaire", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "J'aimerais te voir te faire latter sur un quai de RER", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "T'es vieux, t'as la haine des jeunes", "rhyme": "9n", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "T'as connu les trente glorieuses", "rhyme": "2z", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Pour toi c'\u00e9tait bien plus fun", "rhyme": "yn", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "T'appelles sans arr\u00eat les flics parce que ta vie est trop vite", "rhyme": "it", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Et dans la bouffe de ton caniche, je fout'rai bien du pesticide", "rhyme": "id", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABBCDAEFGHI", "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCDAEFGBB"}, {"section_id": "section_3", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AAAAA", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAA"}, {"section_id": "section_4", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "T'as 22 ans et t'es \u00e0 Sciences Po", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "T'es vraiment trop m\u00e9prisant, arrogant comme un cabot", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Tu veux une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 d'l'effort mais toi t'auras du boulot", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Plac\u00e9 par papa, maman", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Bien au chaud dans un bureau", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Tu vis dans un bled \u00e0 la cambrouse", "rhyme": "uz", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Chez toi y'a pas d'\u00e9tranger", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Et toi pourtant t'as la frousse", "rhyme": "us", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Le soir tu fermes tes volets parce que t'as peur du noir", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "11", "text": "T'as trop mat\u00e9 la t\u00e9l\u00e9, TF1 et L'Droit de Savoir", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABBBCBADEFGG", "rhyme_vowel": "ABBBCBADEDAA"}, {"section_id": "section_5", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AAAAA", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAA"}, {"section_id": "section_6", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Tu gal\u00e8res et t'es au RMI", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Tu t'fais traiter comme une merde, alors t'es dev'nu aigri", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "T'en veux \u00e0 la Terre enti\u00e8re, alors tu t'venges comme tu peux", "rhyme": "2", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Arr\u00eate d'envier ton voisin, tu verras \u00e7a ira mieux", "rhyme": "2", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "C'est s\u00fbr pour moi : les gens tu t'en fous", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Et t'as aucune compassion, des id\u00e9es tout-\u00e0-l'\u00e9gout", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Et que tu sois riche ou pauvre, tu nous inspires le d\u00e9go\u00fbt", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "\u00c9coute Lily d'Pierre Perret, les poulaillers d'acajou", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABBCCADDDD", "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCCADDDD"}, {"section_id": "section_7", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AAAAA", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAA"}, {"section_id": "section_8", "type": "outro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Salaud de droite", "rhyme": "at", "persona_id"